        "created_at": "2023-03-23T18:18:37.983Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Love me some good rules clarifications!</p>\n<p>The optional costs problem has been unsatisfactory for a while, so I’m really glad they came to the conclusion they did! Being able to choose to destroy an Ongoing card when you don’t have one feels silly and wrong.</p>\n<p>Now we just need them to re-answer the question about new Phase effects popping up.</p>",
